{"schema_version":1,"generated_at":"2026-10-12T06:31:22+00:00","image_count":304,"show_slug":"privet_russian","base_url":"https://gallery.nerranetwork.com","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","license_url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","attribution":"Nerra Network","shows":[{"slug":"privet_russian","name":"Привет, Русский!","image_count":304}],"episode_fields":["show_slug","episode_date","episode_id","episode_title"],"episodes":[["privet_russian","2026-10-12","ep073","Ep 73: Today we pack our bags and unlock the Russian words that let you talk about journeys, tickets, and getting from place to place."],["privet_russian","2026-10-05","ep072","Ep 72: Today we head to the shops to master everyday Russian words for buying, browsing and finding great deals!"],["privet_russian","2026-09-28","ep071","Ep 71: Today we explore the warm and expressive world of Russian feelings so you can share exactly how you feel in any moment."],["privet_russian","2026-09-21","ep070","Ep 70: Today we step into a cozy Russian kitchen to master everyday food words that will make your taste buds and your Russian skills happy!"],["privet_russian","2026-09-07","ep069","Ep 69: Today we’re stepping outside into the Russian skies to master everyday weather words that let you talk about sun, wind, and snow like a local."],["privet_russian","2026-08-31","ep068","Ep 68: Today we’re ringing the school bell and unlocking the everyday Russian words that let you talk about classes, teachers, and learning adventures!"],["privet_russian","2026-08-24","ep067","Ep 67: Today we meet some wonderful Russian animal words that will help you talk about the creatures all around us, from tiny birds to big bears."],["privet_russian","2026-08-17","ep066","Ep 66: Today we open the door to the warm, everyday words Russians use to talk about the people closest to them."],["privet_russian","2026-08-10","ep065","Ep 65: Let's dress up our Russian skills today with everyday clothing words that help you talk about what you're wearing right now!"],["privet_russian","2026-08-03","ep064","Ep 64: Step inside a cozy Russian home and unlock the everyday words that let you talk about rooms, furniture, and family life!"],["privet_russian","2026-07-27","ep063","Ep 63: Today we’re strapping on our рюкзак and jetting off to master Russian travel words that turn every trip into an adventure!"],["privet_russian","2026-07-20","ep062","Ep 62: Today we step into Russia's stunning natural world to learn words that let you talk about trees, rivers, forests, and more!"],["privet_russian","2026-07-18","ep061","Ep 61: Today we’re heading to the Russian магазин to unlock shopping words that turn every trip into a language adventure!"],["privet_russian","2026-07-16","ep060","Ep 60: Today we’re tasting our way through tasty Russian food words that will have you saying “вкусно!” like a true local."],["privet_russian","2026-07-14","ep059","Ep 59: Today we step outside into the wild Russian weather to learn words that let you describe sun, rain, wind, and snow like a local."],["privet_russian","2026-07-13","ep058","Ep 58: Today we’re roaring, barking, and chirping our way through the animal kingdom to unlock the Russian words that let you talk about every creature from pets to polar bears!"],["privet_russian","2026-07-12","ep057","Ep 57: Today we unlock the magic of Russian feelings so you can say exactly how happy, tired, or excited you are!"],["privet_russian","2026-07-11","ep056","Ep 56: Today we step into a Russian classroom to unlock the everyday words that let you talk about school, books, and learning like a local!"],["privet_russian","2026-07-10","ep055","Ep 55: Ready to pack your bags and explore Russia? Today’s lesson turns travel words into your passport for adventure!"],["privet_russian","2026-07-08","ep054","Ep 54: Today we open the door to a warm Russian home and meet the people who make it a семья."],["privet_russian","2026-07-06","ep053","Ep 53: Today we're stepping into a cozy Russian kitchen to learn the words that help you talk about delicious meals with family and friends."],["privet_russian","2026-07-04","ep052","Ep 52: Today we learn simple Russian words to describe sunny, rainy, and snowy days so you can chat about the weather like a local!"],["privet_russian","2026-07-02","ep051","Ep 51: Today we dive into the fun world of animals with Russian words that will let you talk about pets, zoos, and favorite creatures right away."],["privet_russian","2026-06-30","ep050","Ep 50: Get ready to pack your bags and explore the world with fun Russian words for travel adventures!"],["privet_russian","2026-06-29","ep049","Ep 49: Today we feast on everyday Russian food words that will help you talk about meals like a local!"],["privet_russian","2026-06-24","ep048","Ep 48: Today we're turning up the heat on your Russian skills with weather words that will help you chat about any forecast!"],["privet_russian","2026-06-22","ep047","Ep 47: Let's leap into the animal kingdom today to learn Russian words for the creatures all around us, from pets to wild friends!"],["privet_russian","2026-06-22","ep046","Ep 46: Today we feast on everyday Russian food words that connect right to your kitchen table and help you talk about what you love to eat."],["privet_russian","2026-06-20","ep045","Ep 45: Let's explore sunny Russian weather words that connect to English in surprising ways!"],["privet_russian","2026-06-19","ep044","Ep 44: Today we’re stepping into the wild world of animals to learn Russian words that will help you talk about everything from tiny bugs to giant whales!"],["privet_russian","2026-06-18","ep043","Ep 43: Ready to feast on Russian food words that will make every meal a language adventure?"],["privet_russian","2026-06-17","ep042","Ep 42: Today we're diving into sunny, rainy, and snowy Russian words so you can chat about the weather like a true explorer!"],["privet_russian","2026-06-16","ep041","Ep 41"],["privet_russian","2026-06-15","ep040","Ep 40: Today w